  "phaseFindings": "Ascent1→3 gives two droop steps;3→7 gathers/lifts while two tails briefly cross and then unwind;7→9 follows through. Separate roots/tips remain traceable. Descent paired curls settle with modest relative plume motion. DESC2→3 local upper-plume opening changes a fixed-ROI angle but does not create a fresh whip in production captures.",
